{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Paperlands</i> is a relaxing 2D puzzle adventure set in a papercraft world where everything can be interacted with only if brought to life with color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new colors as you complete both traditional and environmental puzzles while helping the people of Paperlands with their requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coloring things with different colors is the key and it can have interesting effects which will help you on your journey.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color the objects and people to be able to interact with them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f88a060dca39631d5660a5f2ac2341c8.poster.avif?t=1773327723\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f88a060dca39631d5660a5f2ac2341c8.webm?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/f88a060dca39631d5660a5f2ac2341c8.mp4?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental and traditional puzzles by using the colors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/41f55667cc35ad8e1d37c4e5d777f8de.poster.avif?t=1773327723\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/41f55667cc35ad8e1d37c4e5d777f8de.webm?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/41f55667cc35ad8e1d37c4e5d777f8de.mp4?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new colors and reach new locations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/8296ada491723b67ccbf323942f1c6f9.poster.avif?t=1773327723\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/8296ada491723b67ccbf323942f1c6f9.webm?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/8296ada491723b67ccbf323942f1c6f9.mp4?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get creative and color the world to your liking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/0ab95d54070da5dfa522753ab5028e4b.poster.avif?t=1773327723\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/0ab95d54070da5dfa522753ab5028e4b.webm?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196370/extras/0ab95d54070da5dfa522753ab5028e4b.mp4?t=1773327723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help the people of Paperlands with their requests as you progress on your journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po